### ZakatFlow API walkthrough (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP file)
### Base URL
@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Current settings + nisab thresholds
GET {{base}}/api/settings

### 2. Update metal prices (organizations refresh these regularly)
PUT {{base}}/api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goldPricePerGram": 76.20,
  "silverPricePerGram": 0.97,
  "nisabBasis": "silver"
}

### 3. List payers with latest calculations
GET {{base}}/api/payers

### 4. Create a payer
POST {{base}}/api/payers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maryam Siddiq", "email": "maryam@example.com" }

### 5. Add assets (replace :payerId)
POST {{base}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payerId": ":payerId", "type": "cash", "label": "Savings", "quantity": 8000 }

### 5b. Gold — quantity is GRAMS, valued at settings price automatically
POST {{base}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payerId": ":payerId", "type": "gold", "label": "Gold bangles", "quantity": 45 }

### 5c. Stocks — needs valuePerUnit (market price)
POST {{base}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payerId": ":payerId", "type": "stocks", "label": "Index fund", "quantity": 100, "valuePerUnit": 41.75 }

### 6. Add a deductible liability
POST {{base}}/api/liabilities
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payerId": ":payerId", "label": "Rent due this month", "amount": 900, "dueWithinYear": true }

### 7. RUN THE ZAKAT CALCULATION
# Starts the hawl automatically if wealth reaches nisab for the first time;
# breaks the hawl if wealth fell below nisab (classical rule).
POST {{base}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payerId": ":payerId" }

### 8. Payer detail — assets, liabilities, hawl progress, history
GET {{base}}/api/payers/:payerId

### 9. Recipients (8 asnaf categories enforced)
GET {{base}}/api/recipients

### 9b. Add a recipient — invalid category is rejected with the list of 8
POST {{base}}/api/recipients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Halima Begum", "category": "fuqara", "notes": "Case #15", "verified": true }

### 10. Distribution ledger + pool balance
GET {{base}}/api/distributions

### 10b. Disburse — rejected with 409 if it exceeds the undistributed pool
POST {{base}}/api/distributions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipientId": ":recipientId", "amount": 75.00, "note": "Eid support" }

### 11. Dashboard stats
GET {{base}}/api/stats
